@startuml Feature12_Seq_2
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 12: Interview Pool Management - Sequence: Invite Candidates**

actor Recruiter
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nInterviewPoolController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nInterviewPoolService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nApplicationRepository" as AppRepo
participant "<<repository>>\nSchedulingRepository" as Repo
participant "<<service>>\nMagicLinkService" as MagicLink
participant "Database" as DB

Recruiter -> UI: Select Candidates & Click "Invite"
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/interview-pools/{id}/invite
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: InviteAsync(companyId, userId, poolId, dto)
activate Svc

loop For each applicationId in dto.ApplicationIds
    Svc -> AppRepo: GetByIdAsync(companyId, applicationId)
    activate AppRepo
    AppRepo --> Svc: return Application
    deactivate AppRepo

    note right of Svc: Recruiter only SCHEDULES.\nSkip unless currentState = INTERVIEW\n(Department Manager approves the move)

    Svc -> Repo: InsertInviteScheduleAsync(..., schedule)
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB: INSERT Schedule
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: return scheduleId
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Svc: return scheduleId
    deactivate Repo

    Svc -> MagicLink: IssueAsync(..., "SCHEDULE")
    activate MagicLink
    note right of MagicLink: Generates Token & \nSends Email
    MagicLink --> Svc: return (RawToken, ExpiresAt)
    deactivate MagicLink
end

Svc --> Ctrl: return InviteResultDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON (Invited & Skipped list)
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Recruiter: Show Invite Results
deactivate UI
@enduml
